    "display_code": "KPC1-six-uppercase-four-hex-groups",
    "authority": "auxiliary-comparison-only"
  },
  "semantic_rules": [
    "publication generation one has no predecessor and successors name the exact previous signed publication ID",
    "publication identity and time never move backwards along a verified chain",
    "ticket is non-empty valid UTF-8 and its preserved-domain digest matches exact bytes",
    "observation generation one has no predecessor and successors advance both chain and publication high-water marks",
    "conflict observations name one local account, channel, publisher and publication generation but disagree on publication ID or ticket digest",
    "proof observations are strictly ordered by canonical observation ID and the proof summary matches them",
    "a resolution request embeds and verifies the exact conflict proof and rotates to a distinct write key and strictly newer channel epoch",
    "request authority is checked against an externally supplied current Root-signed device list and is not inferred from the request",
    "a Root-signed resolution binds the request ID, evidence ID, peer, key rotation, route policy and replacement-ticket digest",
    "a response carries the exact replacement ticket and verifies its digest against the Root-signed resolution",
    "request and response claims share one confirmation code while their artifact IDs and claim kinds remain distinct",
    "portable claims are comparison aids and never replace signature or current-authority verification"
  ]
